artificer-class
  shape: UnitClass
rogue-class
  shape: UnitClass
priest-class
  shape: UnitClass
ranger-class
  shape: UnitClass
ready
  shape: EncounterState
active
  shape: EncounterState
victory
  shape: EncounterState
defeat
  shape: EncounterState

player-1 order target Vec3 { x: 0.0, y: 0.0, z: 0.0 }
player-1 chosen target cinder-1
encounter encounter state ready
ready state name "Ready"
active state name "Battle joined"
victory state name "Moonwell restored"
defeat state name "Moonwell lost"
combat-rules burn damage 4.0

